{"id":"66286bf54da44acc","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kucera-coding.md","title":"Kučera–Gács 编码定理","display":"thm-kucera-coding — Kučera–Gács 编码定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kucera-coding","aliases":["43-thm-kucera-coding"],"display":"thm-kucera-coding — Kučera–Gács 编码定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-wtt]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.3 Theorem 11.3.2，印刷254–255，PDF274–275","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kucera-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kucera-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kucera-coding — Kučera–Gács 编码定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.3 Theorem 11.3.2，印刷254–255，PDF274–275"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land A\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}X\\land A\\le_TX\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land A\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}X\\land A\\le_TX\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原节点仅给Turing归约，源书Theorem 11.3.2实际给出wtt归约，已补足。不能替换为tt归约：若A为不完备非可计算c.e.集，Demuth定理会形成反例障碍。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.3 Theorem 11.3.2，印刷254–255，PDF274–275。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-wtt","status":"resolved","id":"01ea56c49b64bbfd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-wtt]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_T$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-wtt]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_T$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-wtt]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-wtt","status":"resolved","id":"01ea56c49b64bbfd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_T$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-wtt]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land A\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}X\\land A\\le_TX\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1237,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-258","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kucera-coding]] — Kučera–Gács 编码定理"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","0784d1de3a88cd94","01ea56c49b64bbfd"]}